## Rules

- Drive the flow your change touches, and the flows that must always work.
- When a check still fails after three attempts at a fix, stop and ask a person. Say what you tried.
- Never make a check pass by skipping it, running it again or adding a sleep. Fix the cause of a flaky check, or delete the check and write down why.
